    [5256]={name="Kovork's Rattle",quality=2,ilvl=35,reqLevel=30,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Kovork.",zone="Arathi Highlands",npc="Kovork"},
    [5267]={name="Scarlet Kris",quality=3,ilvl=63,reqLevel=58,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 55-73."},
    [5279]={name="Harpy Skinner",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=12,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Serena Bloodfeather'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Darsok Swiftdagger in The Barrens. Objective: Slay Serena Bloodfeather and return her head to Darsok Swiftdagger at the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Serena Bloodfeather",lore="You did so well with the lieutenants and underlings that I'd like you to do one last thing for me. Serena Bloodfeather is the sister of a harpy named Bloodfeather who was slain by Rexxar quite a while ago."},
    [5299]={name="Gloves of the Moon",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cry of the Thunderhawk'. Starts with Jorn Skyseer in The Barrens. Objective: Find and slay a Thunderhawk, return its wings to Jorn Skyseer at Camp Taurajo.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Cry of the Thunderhawk",lore="The thunderhawk, is a fierce beast. It is time for you to face them. You must find where it roams, and bring me its wings as proof of your successful hunt."},
    [5302]={name="Cobalt Buckler",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cry of the Thunderhawk'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jorn Skyseer in The Barrens. Objective: Find and slay a Thunderhawk, return its wings to Jorn Skyseer at Camp Taurajo.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Cry of the Thunderhawk",lore="The thunderhawk, is a fierce beast. It is time for you to face them. You must find where it roams, and bring me its wings as proof of your successful hunt."},
    [5309]={name="Privateer Musket",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=13,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Guns of Northwatch'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Captain Thalo'thas Brightsun in The Barrens. Objective: Captain Thalo'thas Brightsun of Ratchet wants you to collect 10 Theramore Medals and slay Captain Fairmount, Cannoneer Whessan and Cannoneer Smythe.",zone="The Barrens",questName="The Guns of Northwatch",lore="Yet another ship from my fleet has been lost to those overzealous humans at Northwatch Hold! Those bastards must be dealt with. Their paranoia has them in a state of frenzy."},
    [5312]={name="Riveted Gauntlets",quality=2,ilvl=21,reqLevel=13,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Free From the Hold'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gilthares Firebough in The Barrens. Objective: Safely escort Gilthares Firebough back to Captain Brightsun in Ratchet.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Free From the Hold",lore="Finally! Someone to rescue me! I can't believe you got past the guards. These zealots from Theramore are out of their minds. They sank our ship and imprisoned me, the only survivor."},
    [5317]={name="Dry Moss Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=25,reqLevel=17,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Betrayal from Within'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mangletooth in The Barrens. Objective: Bring Lok's Skull to Thork at the Crossroads in the Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Betrayal from Within",lore="Take Lok's head to Thork in the Crossroads. He should know what has happened to my tribe without any words--ha, not that he would believe Mangletooth helped in such things."},
    [5318]={name="Zhovur Axe",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=12,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Serena Bloodfeather'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Darsok Swiftdagger in The Barrens. Objective: Slay Serena Bloodfeather and return her head to Darsok Swiftdagger at the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Serena Bloodfeather",lore="You did so well with the lieutenants and underlings that I'd like you to do one last thing for me. Serena Bloodfeather is the sister of a harpy named Bloodfeather who was slain by Rexxar quite a while ago."},
    [5319]={name="Bashing Pauldrons",quality=1,ilvl=20,reqLevel=15,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Haren Swifthoof.",zone="Loch Modan",npc="Haren Swifthoof"},
    [5320]={name="Padded Lamellar Boots",quality=2,ilvl=16,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Stolen Booty'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gazlowe in The Barrens. Objective: Retrieve the Shipment of Boots and Telescopic Lens for Gazlowe in Ratchet.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Stolen Booty",lore="While I'd like to recover all my goods, I'm sure that's not possible. Still, there's a few things that I absolutely must have! As you see, my observatory is ready to go, but it needs the smaller of the two lenses."},
    [5321]={name="Elegant Shortsword",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=12,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Serena Bloodfeather'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Darsok Swiftdagger in The Barrens. Objective: Slay Serena Bloodfeather and return her head to Darsok Swiftdagger at the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Serena Bloodfeather",lore="You did so well with the lieutenants and underlings that I'd like you to do one last thing for me. Serena Bloodfeather is the sister of a harpy named Bloodfeather who was slain by Rexxar quite a while ago."},
    [5322]={name="Demolition Hammer",quality=2,ilvl=26,reqLevel=17,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Weapons of Choice'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Tatternack Steelforge in The Barrens. Objective: Bring a Razormane Backstabber, a Charred Razormane Wand and a Razormane War Shield to Tatternack Steelforge at Camp Taurajo in the Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Weapons of Choice",lore="The Razormane quilboars to the south, beyond the Field of Giants, have no skilled blacksmiths from what I am told, but they've apparently started to develop sturdier weapons."},
    [5324]={name="Engineer's Hammer",quality=2,ilvl=16,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Samophlange'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in The Barrens. Objective: Return the Samophlange to Sputtervalve in Ratchet.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Samophlange",lore="Pulling open the face of the control console reveals a dense jumble of wires, tubing and other strange mechanical objects--most of which seem to serve no practical purpose."},
    [5325]={name="Welding Shield",quality=2,ilvl=16,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Samophlange'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in The Barrens. Objective: Return the Samophlange to Sputtervalve in Ratchet.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Samophlange",lore="Pulling open the face of the control console reveals a dense jumble of wires, tubing and other strange mechanical objects--most of which seem to serve no practical purpose."},
    [5328]={name="Cinched Belt",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Disruption Ends'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Thork in The Barrens. Objective: Kill 8 Razormane Geomancers, 8 Razormane Defenders, and Kreenig Snarlsnout.Then bring Kreenig Snarlsnout's Tusk to Thork at the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="The Disruption Ends",lore="One of my scouts witnessed an attack on a caravan from Durotar. The culprits are indeed the Razormane tribe of quilboars. One of the quilboars in particular is leading the raids: Kreenig Snarlsnout."},
    [5341]={name="Spore-covered Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Root Samples'. Starts with Mebok Mizzyrix in The Barrens. Objective: Bring 8 Root Samples to Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Root Samples",lore="The herbs of the Barrens are not quite like herbs in other lands. Their properties are mostly the same, but the oasis water here alters the plants; they are just slightly different."},
    [5343]={name="Barkeeper's Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=13,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Raptor Horns'. Starts with Mebok Mizzyrix in The Barrens. Objective: Gather 5 Intact Raptor Horns from Sunscale Scytheclaws, and bring them to Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Raptor Horns",lore="The raptors of the Barrens are smarter than raptors in other lands. And I think all that smarts is hiding in their horns!"},
    [5346]={name="Orcish Battle Bow",quality=2,ilvl=14,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Centaur Bracers'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Regthar Deathgate in The Barrens. Objective: Bring 15 Centaur Bracers to Regthar Deathgate, west of the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Centaur Bracers",lore="The Kolkar are a threat to the Horde's claims in the Barrens; we must reduce the numbers of their troops. And so, I have a bounty task for you."},
    [5351]={name="Bounty Hunter's Ring",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=11,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hezrul Bloodmark'. Starts with Regthar Deathgate in The Barrens. Objective: Bring Hezrul's Head to Regthar Deathgate, west of the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Hezrul Bloodmark",lore="Hezrul Bloodmark is the leader of the Kolkar centaurs in the Barrens. He is fierce, brutal and cunning. Defeating him would disrupt and fracture the Kolkars, greatly reducing their threat to us."},
    [5355]={name="Beastmaster's Girdle",quality=2,ilvl=28,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Isha Awak'. Starts with Mahren Skyseer in The Barrens. Objective: Bring the Heart of Isha Awak to Mahren Skyseer.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Isha Awak",lore="The grand Isha Awak is lord of these waters. Great is his strength, and solemn his pride. The humans on the coast fear him, for he has consumed many of their number."},
    [5357]={name="Ward of the Vale",quality=2,ilvl=27,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Isha Awak'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mahren Skyseer in The Barrens. Objective: Bring the Heart of Isha Awak to Mahren Skyseer.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Isha Awak",lore="The grand Isha Awak is lord of these waters. Great is his strength, and solemn his pride. The humans on the coast fear him, for he has consumed many of their number."},
    [5399]={name="Tracking Boots",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Woodland Protector'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Tarindrella in Teldrassil. Objective: Collect 8 Fel Moss and bring them to Tarindrella.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="The Woodland Protector",lore="Something evil is brewing in the forests of Teldrassil. Look long the hills to where the peaceful furbolgs used to dwell. They have deserted their homes and are amassing under the name of the Gnarlpine tribe."},
    [5404]={name="Serpent's Shoulders",quality=3,ilvl=23,reqLevel=18,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Lady Anacondra.",zone="Wailing Caverns",npc="Lady Anacondra"},
    [5422]={name="Brambleweed Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=22,reqLevel=17,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Boahn.",zone="Wailing Caverns",npc="Boahn"},
    [5423]={name="Boahn's Fang",quality=3,ilvl=22,reqLevel=17,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Boahn.",zone="Wailing Caverns",npc="Boahn"},
    [5425]={name="Runescale Girdle",quality=3,ilvl=21,reqLevel=16,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Trigore the Lasher.",zone="Wailing Caverns",npc="Trigore the Lasher"},
    [5426]={name="Serpent's Kiss",quality=3,ilvl=21,reqLevel=16,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Trigore the Lasher.",zone="Wailing Caverns",npc="Trigore the Lasher"},
    [5443]={name="Gold-plated Buckler",quality=3,ilvl=22,reqLevel=17,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Miner Johnson.",zone="The Deadmines",npc="Miner Johnson"},
    [5444]={name="Miner's Cape",quality=3,ilvl=22,reqLevel=17,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Miner Johnson.",zone="The Deadmines",npc="Miner Johnson"},
    [5540]={name="Pearl-handled Dagger",quality=2,ilvl=23,reqLevel=18,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 1).",profession="Blacksmithing"},
    [5541]={name="Iridescent Hammer",quality=2,ilvl=28,reqLevel=23,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 1).",profession="Blacksmithing"},
    [5589]={name="Moss-covered Gauntlets",quality=1,ilvl=10,reqLevel=4,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Oakenscowl'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Denalan in Teldrassil. Objective: Denalan at Lake Al'Ameth wants you to collect the Gargantuan Tumor from Oakenscowl.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Oakenscowl",lore="In a cave along the southern bank of the lake, a timberling named Oakenscowl is spreading corruption to all the creatures that make Lake Al'Ameth their home."},
    [5592]={name="Shackled Girdle",quality=1,ilvl=11,reqLevel=6,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Enchanted Glade'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak in Teldrassil. Objective: Acquire 6 Bloodfeather Belts and bring them to Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak in the Oracle Glade.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="The Enchanted Glade",lore="I was dispatched with a small group of Sentinels here to protect the Oracle Tree from the harpies that have made nests all around the glade."},
    [5593]={name="Crag Buckler",quality=1,ilvl=11,reqLevel=7,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mist'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Teldrassil. Objective: Escort Mist to Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak at the moon well near the Oracle Tree.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Mist",lore="The sabercat's fur is a distinctive gray color, blending into the surrounding forest. As she lays there, you observe that she is badly wounded, with deep lacerations across her back and stomach."},
    [5609]={name="Steadfast Cinch",quality=2,ilvl=22,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Escape Through Force'. Starts with Volcor in Darkshore. Objective: Protect Volcor until you reach the road, then speak to Terenthis in Auberdine.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Escape Through Force",lore="All right, force it is. Let's get out of here as soon as you're ready. We'll fight our way down to the road--Grimclaw should still be there."},
    [5610]={name="Gustweald Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=12,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cave Mushrooms'. Starts with Barithras Moonshade in Darkshore. Objective: Bring 5 Scaber Stalks and 1 Death Cap to Barithras Moonshade in Auberdine.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Cave Mushrooms",lore="I am devising a potion that requires rare mushrooms, mushrooms that grow only in a certain cave. The cave lies behind Cliffspring Falls, to the east and slightly north along the mountains."},
    [5614]={name="Seraph's Strike",quality=2,ilvl=31,reqLevel=13,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Tower of Althalaxx'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Balthule Shadowstrike in Ashenvale. Objective: Talk to Delgren the Purifier at Maestra's Post.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Tower of Althalaxx",lore="For all the work that you have done, you deserve to be well rewarded. Return to Delgren and tell him that Athrikus Narassin lies stilled by your hand, and the Cult of the Dark Strand is beaten and scattered."},
    [5615]={name="Woodsman Sword",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=12,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mathystra Relics'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Onu in Darkshore. Objective: Bring 6 Mathystra Relics to Onu at the Grove of the Ancients.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Mathystra Relics",lore="The parchment you found at the Master's Glaive is a page from an ancient text...written by elves!"},
    [5622]={name="Clergy Ring",quality=2,ilvl=22,reqLevel=13,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Tower of Althalaxx'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Balthule Shadowstrike in Ashenvale. Objective: Talk to Delgren the Purifier at Maestra's Post.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Tower of Althalaxx",lore="Ilkrud Magthrull. Yes, I have knowledge of him. He is a powerful orc warlock that makes his residence at the Fire Scar Shrine, a place of great evil in southwestern Ashenvale."},
    [5626]={name="Skullchipper",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Absent Minded Prospector'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Absent Minded Prospector",lore="Prospector Whelgar now holds the original fossil at his site in the Wetlands. When I discovered the Stone of Relu, I believed it to be the key to unlocking the mystery of the fossil."},
    [5627]={name="Relic Blade",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Absent Minded Prospector'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Absent Minded Prospector",lore="When I discovered the Stone of Relu, I believed it to be the key to unlocking the mystery of the fossil. While I traveled on the road to meet Whelgar, I was attacked by raptors and the relic was lost."},
    [5744]={name="Pale Skinner",quality=2,ilvl=14,reqLevel=9,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Fedfennel.",zone="Elwynn Forest",npc="Fedfennel"},
    [5749]={name="Scythe Axe",quality=2,ilvl=25,reqLevel=20,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Ma'ruk Wyrmscale.",zone="Wetlands",npc="Ma'ruk Wyrmscale"},
    [5750]={name="Warchief's Girdle",quality=2,ilvl=25,reqLevel=20,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Ma'ruk Wyrmscale.",zone="Wetlands",npc="Ma'ruk Wyrmscale"},
    [5752]={name="Wyvern Tailspike",quality=2,ilvl=27,reqLevel=22,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Pridewing Patriarch.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",npc="Pridewing Patriarch"},
    [5753]={name="Ruffled Chaplet",quality=2,ilvl=31,reqLevel=26,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Terrowulf Packlord.",zone="Ashenvale",npc="Terrowulf Packlord"},
    [5755]={name="Onyx Shredder Plate",quality=2,ilvl=35,reqLevel=30,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Venture Co. Shredder.",zone="Zul'Gurub",npc="Venture Co. Shredder"},
    [5757]={name="Hardwood Cudgel",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=12,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mathystra Relics'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Onu in Darkshore. Objective: Bring 6 Mathystra Relics to Onu at the Grove of the Ancients.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Mathystra Relics",lore="The parchment you found at the Master's Glaive is a page from an ancient text...written by elves!"},
    [5780]={name="Murloc Scale Belt",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=13,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 1).",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [5781]={name="Murloc Scale Breastplate",quality=2,ilvl=19,reqLevel=14,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 1).",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [5783]={name="Murloc Scale Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=38,reqLevel=33,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 1).",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [5813]={name="Emil's Brand",quality=2,ilvl=32,reqLevel=24,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Insane Druids'. Starts with Kayneth Stillwind in Ashenvale. Objective: Kill the druids: Taneel Darkwood, Uthil Mooncall, Mavoris Cloudsbreak; then return to Kayneth Stillwind in Forest Song.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Insane Druids",lore="When I struggled with the Forsaken's poisons, I had a vision. I had a vision of the druids in the Dor'danil Barrow Den, poisoned... murdered by the undead!"},
    [5815]={name="Glacial Stone",quality=2,ilvl=31,reqLevel=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Raene's Cleansing'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Krolg in Ashenvale. Objective: Bring Ran Bloodtooth's Skull and Dartol's Rod of Transformation to Raene Wolfrunner in Astranaar.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Raene's Cleansing",lore="Return to your own tribe and let them know of your victory here. Show them your trophy, and bask in the glory..."},
    [5817]={name="Lunaris Bow",quality=2,ilvl=30,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Answered Questions'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jonathan Carevin in Darnassus. Objective: Return to Thyn'tel Bladeweaver in Darnassus.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Answered Questions",lore="We shall rein in the worgen problem, have no worry of that. This evil that your friend introduced to our woods will be contained, and I bear her no ill will for her actions."},
    [5819]={name="Sunblaze Coif",quality=3,ilvl=33,reqLevel=28,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 29-40.",zone="Tirisfal Glades",zoneOpen=true},
    [5820]={name="Faerie Mantle",quality=2,ilvl=32,reqLevel=26,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Branch of Cenarius'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Anilia in Ashenvale. Objective: Kill Geltharis and return the Branch of Cenarius to Illiyana at the Shrine of Aessina.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="The Branch of Cenarius",lore="Anilia puts her hands on your shoulders and draws you close. Gasping, she points towards the arch to the north, before her eyes close and her last wheezing breath leaves her body."},
    [5940]={name="Bone Buckler",quality=1,ilvl=12,reqLevel=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Prodigal Lich Returns'. Starts with Gunther Arcanus in Undercity. Objective: Bring the Nether Gem to Bethor Iceshard in the Undercity.",zone="Tirisfal Glades",questName="The Prodigal Lich Returns",lore="Take this Nether Gem to my old comrade Bethor. It will let us communicate... and I have much to tell him."},
    [5944]={name="Greaves of the People's Militia",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Red Leather Bandanas'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Scout Galiaan in Westfall. Objective: Bring 15 Red Leather Bandanas to Scout Galiaan at Sentinel Hill.",zone="Westfall",questName="Red Leather Bandanas",lore="The Defias Front is constantly shifting. I've been following their movements for quite some time now. On a side note, I've ascertained that many members of the gang can be tracked by the Red Leather Bandanas they wear."},
    [5971]={name="Feathered Cape",quality=2,ilvl=28,reqLevel=23,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Vultros.",zone="Westfall",npc="Vultros"},
    [5975]={name="Ruffian Belt",quality=2,ilvl=23,reqLevel=18,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Rot Hide Bruiser.",zone="Alterac Mountains",npc="Rot Hide Bruiser"},
    [6061]={name="Graystone Bracers",quality=1,ilvl=8,reqLevel=4,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Timberling Sprouts'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Denalan in Teldrassil. Objective: Bring 12 Timberling Sprouts to Denalan at Lake Al'Ameth.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Timberling Sprouts",lore="Small timberlings are sprouting around the waters of Lake Al'Ameth. I'm afraid these sprouts are beyond help -- we should try to clear them from the land before they grow large enough to cause trouble."},
    [6063]={name="Cold Steel Gauntlets",quality=1,ilvl=8,reqLevel=4,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Graverobbers'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Magistrate Sevren in Tirisfal Glades. Objective: Kill Rot Hide Graverobbers and Rot Hide Mongrels. Bring 8 Embalming Ichors to Magistrate Sevren in Brill.",zone="Tirisfal Glades",questName="Graverobbers",lore="The Mass Graves, southwest of Garren's Haunt to the north, were made to accommodate the...impressive...number of deaths Tirisfal suffered when the Plague first came."},
    [6084]={name="Stormwind Guard Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=13,reqLevel=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wanted: \"Hogger\"'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Elwynn Forest",questName="Wanted:  \"Hogger\"",lore="He has overpowered all attempts at his capture. The Stormwind Army has placed a generous bounty on the Gnoll."},
    [6085]={name="Footman Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=13,reqLevel=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wanted: \"Hogger\"'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Elwynn Forest",questName="Wanted:  \"Hogger\"",lore="Wanted: Hogger A huge gnoll, Hogger, is prowling the woods in southwestern Elwynn. He has overpowered all attempts at his capture. The Stormwind Army has placed a generous bounty on the Gnoll."},
    [6087]={name="Chausses of Westfall",quality=3,ilvl=24,reqLevel=14,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Defias Brotherhood'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="The Deadmines",questName="The Defias Brotherhood",lore="Edwin VanCleef must be assassinated. While it saddens me to condemn any man to a death sentence, it is for the greater good of the people of Westfall that VanCleef is laid to rest once and for all."},
    [6093]={name="Orc Crusher",quality=2,ilvl=27,reqLevel=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Tharil'zun'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Redridge Mountains",questName="Tharil'zun",lore="Blackrock Outrunners and Renegades are running ambushes between here and Stonewatch Keep. The leader of the Outrunners is an orc named Tharil'zun--we want this orc."},
    [6094]={name="Piercing Axe",quality=2,ilvl=19,reqLevel=14,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Red Silk Bandanas'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Scout Riell in Westfall. Objective: Scout Riell at the Sentinel Hill Tower wants you to bring her 10 Red Silk Bandanas.",zone="The Deadmines",questName="Red Silk Bandanas",lore="It's no secret that the trademark of the Defias Gang is their Red Bandanas. But we've learned that the material from which these bandanas are made signifies the member's rank."},
    [6148]={name="Web-covered Boots",quality=1,ilvl=10,reqLevel=5,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Mother Fang.",zone="Elwynn Forest",npc="Mother Fang"},
    [6177]={name="Ironwrought Bracers",quality=1,ilvl=12,reqLevel=7,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Tundra MacGrann's Stolen Stash'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Dun Morogh. Objective: Retrieve Tundra MacGrann's dried meats from the stolen meat locker in Old Icebeard's cave.",zone="Dun Morogh",questName="Tundra MacGrann's Stolen Stash",lore="I had a month's worth of dried meats salted and locked away for the cold season. Kept it locked so the bears wouldn't get it! But while I was off hunting deer, that beast, Old Icebeard, made off with the meat locker."},
    [6179]={name="Privateer's Cape",quality=2,ilvl=21,reqLevel=16,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Brack.",zone="Westfall",npc="Brack"},
    [6180]={name="Slarkskin",quality=2,ilvl=17,reqLevel=12,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Slark.",zone="Westfall",npc="Slark"},
    [6186]={name="Trogg Slicer",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=13,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gathering Idols'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Magmar Fellhew in Loch Modan. Objective: Bring Magmar Fellhew 8 Carved Stone Idols.",zone="Loch Modan",questName="Gathering Idols",lore="It makes them go berserk! Bring me 8 idols - I want to study them, and I want them out of Trogg hands!"},
    [6187]={name="Dwarven Defender",quality=2,ilvl=17,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'In Defense of the King's Lands'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Captain Rugelfuss in Loch Modan. Objective: Kill the Trogg leader, Grawmug, and his two guards, Gnasher and Brawler then report back to Captain Rugelfuss in the southern guard tower.",zone="Loch Modan",questName="In Defense of the King's Lands",lore="our scouts have identified the leader of this recent Trogg incursion. It appears that these beasts in Loch Modan are following the lead of a chieftain named Grawmug."},
    [6188]={name="Mud Stompers",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Protecting the Shipment'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Miran in Loch Modan. Objective: Ensure Miran and the shipment arrive at the excavation site, then inform Prospector Ironband.",zone="Loch Modan",questName="Protecting the Shipment",lore="Ready to go? First, we need to get this powder to Ironband. It'll be a lot for me to carry, and these parts can get dangerous -- and who knows what else the Dark Irons might have in store for me."},
    [6189]={name="Durable Chain Shoulders",quality=2,ilvl=24,reqLevel=17,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'WANTED: Chok'sul'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Loch Modan",questName="WANTED: Chok'sul",lore="By order of the Magistrate of Thelsamar: Chok'sul, the ogre presumed to be the leader and coordinator of attacks against the town of Thelsamar, Stonewrought Dam, and the excavation site, is wanted dead through any means necessary."},
    [6194]={name="Barreling Reaper",quality=2,ilvl=32,reqLevel=23,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Defeat Nek'rosh'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Wetlands. Objective: Kill Chieftain Nek'roshBring Nek'rosh's Head to Captain Stoutfist.",zone="Wetlands",questName="Defeat Nek'rosh",lore="Now that the catapults have been burned, find and kill Chieftain Nek'rosh."},
