    [6664]={name="Voodoo Mantle",quality=2,ilvl=26,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Jin'Zil's Forest Magic'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Witch Doctor Jin'Zil in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Witch Doctor Jin'Zil at Malaka'jin wants 5 portions of Stonetalon Sap, 5 Twilight Whiskers, 30 Courser Eyes and a Fey Dragon Scale.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Jin'Zil's Forest Magic",lore="So excited I am! Three little cages for three little elves! But what shall we do with our lovely tree-hugging friends? Why, let's give them a taste of..."},
    [6665]={name="Hexed Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=26,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Jin'Zil's Forest Magic'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Witch Doctor Jin'Zil in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Witch Doctor Jin'Zil at Malaka'jin wants 5 portions of Stonetalon Sap, 5 Twilight Whiskers, 30 Courser Eyes and a Fey Dragon Scale.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Jin'Zil's Forest Magic",lore="So excited I am! Three little cages for three little elves! But what shall we do with our lovely tree-hugging friends? Why, let's give them a taste of..."},
    [6666]={name="Dredge Boots",quality=2,ilvl=22,reqLevel=17,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gerenzo's Orders'. Starts with Piznik in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Get the mysterious ore from Piznik after he finishes mining it.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Gerenzo's Orders",lore="I guess I'd better think about getting out of here, also. It won't take long for word of what happened here to spread to the higher ups, and I'm sure they wouldn't take too kindly to meeting me again."},
    [6667]={name="Engineer's Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=27,reqLevel=16,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ziz Fizziks in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Bring Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle's Mechanical Arm to Ziz Fizziks in the Stonetalon Mountains.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle",lore="I met Gerenzo once, but let me tell you, he's not easy on the eyes. His flesh looks like it's rotting away, and he's grafted metal and gears onto his body, replaced some of his limbs with mechanical ones."},
    [6668]={name="Draftsman Boots",quality=2,ilvl=27,reqLevel=16,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ziz Fizziks in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Bring Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle's Mechanical Arm to Ziz Fizziks in the Stonetalon Mountains.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle",lore="I met Gerenzo once, but let me tell you, he's not easy on the eyes. His flesh looks like it's rotting away, and he's grafted metal and gears onto his body, replaced some of his limbs with mechanical ones."},
    [6671]={name="Juggernaut Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=27,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Den'. Starts with Braelyn Firehand in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Travel to the Den on Stonetalon Peak. Using the Gatekeeper's Key, obtain the druids' hidden items. Use these items to open the Talon Den Hoard.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="The Den",lore="The druids built the Talon Den on Stonetalon Peak, where they keep many powerful items. They devised a complex scheme to keep them from falling into the wrong hands."},
    [6675]={name="Tempered Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=27,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Reclaiming the Charred Vale'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Keeper Albagorm in Feralas. Objective: Travel to Falfindel Waywarder on the border of Thousand Needles and Feralas.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Reclaiming the Charred Vale",lore="The Bloodfuries have been subdued. But they will regroup soon enough if action is not taken. Far south of the Barrens lies a land known as Thousand Needles."},
    [6676]={name="Constable Buckler",quality=2,ilvl=27,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Reclaiming the Charred Vale'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Keeper Albagorm in Feralas. Objective: Travel to Falfindel Waywarder on the border of Thousand Needles and Feralas.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Reclaiming the Charred Vale",lore="The Bloodfuries have been subdued. But they will regroup soon enough if action is not taken. Far south of the Barrens lies a land known as Thousand Needles."},
    [6678]={name="Band of Elven Grace",quality=2,ilvl=28,reqLevel=17,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Reception from Tyrande'. Starts with Sentinel Thenysil in Darnassus. Objective: Find Tyrande Whisperwind in Darnassus.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Reception from Tyrande",lore="I am sure Tyrande Whisperwind herself would like to thank you for taking part in this mission. It may not appear so on the surface, but what you've helped start could very well strengthen our foothold in the Stonetalon Mountains."},
    [6681]={name="Thornspike",quality=3,ilvl=32,reqLevel=27,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Aggem Thorncurse.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Aggem Thorncurse"},
    [6686]={name="Tusken Helm",quality=3,ilvl=34,reqLevel=29,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Overlord Ramtusk.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Overlord Ramtusk"},
    [6687]={name="Corpsemaker",quality=3,ilvl=34,reqLevel=29,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Overlord Ramtusk.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Overlord Ramtusk"},
    [6688]={name="Whisperwind Headdress",quality=3,ilvl=34,reqLevel=29,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Earthcaller Halmgar.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Earthcaller Halmgar"},
    [6690]={name="Ferine Leggings",quality=3,ilvl=34,reqLevel=29,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Agathelos the Raging.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Agathelos the Raging"},
    [6692]={name="Pronged Reaver",quality=3,ilvl=35,reqLevel=30,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Charlga Razorflank.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Charlga Razorflank"},
    [6695]={name="Stygian Bone Amulet",quality=3,ilvl=34,reqLevel=29,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Blind Hunter.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Blind Hunter"},
    [6696]={name="Nightstalker Bow",quality=3,ilvl=34,reqLevel=29,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Blind Hunter.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Blind Hunter"},
    [6697]={name="Batwing Mantle",quality=3,ilvl=34,reqLevel=29,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Blind Hunter.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Blind Hunter"},
    [6719]={name="Windborne Belt",quality=2,ilvl=30,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Highperch Venom'. Starts with Fiora Longears in Dustwallow Marsh. Objective: Bring 10 Highperch Venom Sacs to Fiora Longears in Theramore.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Highperch Venom",lore="As you may know, wyverns are often tamed by orcs for use as mounts. But what is less known is that the venom of a wyvern, in some circles, is more valuable than the beast itself."},
    [6720]={name="Spirit Hunter Headdress",quality=2,ilvl=37,reqLevel=26,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Frostmaw'. Starts with Melor Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Bring Frostmaw's Mane to Melor Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="Frostmaw",lore="it is now time for you to travel to far-off lands. You are ready. You now hunt Frostmaw, a yeti in the Alterac Mountains. He is elusive, his white coat blending into the snows of his mountain home."},
    [6721]={name="Chestplate of Kor",quality=2,ilvl=24,reqLevel=19,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Supplies to Auberdine'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Feero Ironhand in Ashenvale. Objective: Speak with Delgren the Purifier at Maestra's Post after seeing Feero safely through Ashenvale Forest.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Supplies to Auberdine",lore="Delgren has asked me to deliver messages and supplies to Sentinel Starbreeze in Auberdine, but I am loathe to leave on my own."},
    [6722]={name="Beastial Manacles",quality=2,ilvl=30,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Fallen Sky Lake'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Pelturas Whitemoon in Ashenvale. Objective: Retrieve a Fallen Moonstone from the Shadethicket Oracle, then bring it to Pelturas in Astranaar.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Fallen Sky Lake",lore="Relara's fever has passed, but she is still very weak. I do not believe time alone will give her back the strength she has lost. I believe it will take the power of a moonstone."},
    [6725]={name="Marbled Buckler",quality=3,ilvl=36,reqLevel=29,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Crone of the Kraul'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="The Crone of the Kraul",lore="Poor Heralath! And this dwarf... Lonebrow. What a brave soul he was. We must not let their valiance go for naught. This crone... Charlga Razorflank..."},
    [6727]={name="Razzeric's Racing Grips",quality=2,ilvl=41,reqLevel=29,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Safety First'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Shreev in Thousand Needles. Objective: Return the Modified Seaforium Booster to Razzeric on the Shimmering Flats.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Safety First",lore="There, I did what Razzeric wanted. Just tell him to be careful when he sets this off. If he makes the slightest mistake, he won't be moving forward, he'll just be a burnt spot on the track."},
    [6730]={name="Ironforge Chain",quality=2,ilvl=16,reqLevel=11,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 1).",profession="Blacksmithing"},
    [6731]={name="Ironforge Breastplate",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=15,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 1).",profession="Blacksmithing"},
    [6733]={name="Ironforge Gauntlets",quality=2,ilvl=28,reqLevel=23,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 1).",profession="Blacksmithing"},
    [6738]={name="Bleeding Crescent",quality=2,ilvl=35,reqLevel=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Parts of the Swarm'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Korran in Orgrimmar. Objective: Return to Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Parts of the Swarm",lore="Head back to Belgrom in Orgrimmar and tell him Moktar be doing his bidding well out in the Thousand Needles. Tell him also, that me studies progress, and I hope to be havin' learned more soon."},
    [6739]={name="Cliffrunner's Aim",quality=2,ilvl=29,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Sacred Flame'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Rau Cliffrunner in Thousand Needles. Objective: Retrieve the Cloven Hoof for Rau Cliffrunner at the Freewind Post.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="The Sacred Flame",lore="Using the water you brought, you will be able to temporarily douse the flame that holds the centaur relic. It will not work permanently, however, so you will have to be quick about it."},
    [6742]={name="Stonefist Girdle",quality=3,ilvl=36,reqLevel=29,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Crone of the Kraul'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="The Crone of the Kraul",lore="Poor Heralath! And this dwarf... Lonebrow. What a brave soul he was. We must not let their valiance go for naught. This crone... Charlga Razorflank..."},
    [6743]={name="Sustaining Ring",quality=2,ilvl=25,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Knowledge in the Deeps'. Starts with Gerrig Bonegrip in Ironforge. Objective: Bring the Lorgalis Manuscript to Gerrig Bonegrip in the Forlorn Cavern in Ironforge.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Knowledge in the Deeps",lore="As you might know, I collect lore. Old lore. Powerful lore. Lore that opens doorways, and lore that can awaken Those Who Sleep."},
    [6746]={name="Basalt Buckler",quality=2,ilvl=40,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Corrupter'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Takata Steelblade in Desolace. Objective: Slay Lord Azrethoc and Jugkar Grim'rod and return to Takata Steelblade in Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="The Corrupter",lore="Although I have no knowledge of this Lord Azrethoc, I agree with Maurin, he must be stopped; especially if he is attempting to gain influence over the Burning Blade to further his goals."},
    [6747]={name="Enforcer Pauldrons",quality=2,ilvl=40,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Corrupter'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Takata Steelblade in Desolace. Objective: Slay Lord Azrethoc and Jugkar Grim'rod and return to Takata Steelblade in Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="The Corrupter",lore="Although I have no knowledge of this Lord Azrethoc, I agree with Maurin, he must be stopped; especially if he is attempting to gain influence over the Burning Blade to further his goals."},
    [6752]={name="Lancer Boots",quality=2,ilvl=32,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mortality Wanes'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="Mortality Wanes",lore="I have not long to live... so... so... weak....the b-b-brave dwarf, Lonebrow, has been sent to w-w-warn Falfindel... But before I... d-d-die......my wife, Treshala..."},
    [6757]={name="Jaina's Signet Ring",quality=2,ilvl=38,reqLevel=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Missing Diplomat'. Starts with Tapoke \\\"Slim\\\" Jahn in Wetlands. Objective: Speak to Mikhail in the Wetlands.",zone="Stormwind City",questName="The Missing Diplomat"},
    [6773]={name="Gelkis Marauder Chain",quality=2,ilvl=42,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Khan Hratha'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Uthek the Wise in Desolace. Objective: Maintain your reputation with the Gelkis, and bring the Maraudine Key Fragment to Uthek the Wise in the Gelkis Village.",zone="Desolace",questName="Khan Hratha",lore="you helped us against the Magram. Now, help us beat the Maraudine! Kill the head of their clan, Khan Hratha! To face him, blow the Maraudine War Horn."},
    [6788]={name="Magram Hunter's Belt",quality=2,ilvl=42,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Khan Hratha'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Uthek the Wise in Desolace. Objective: Maintain your reputation with the Gelkis, and bring the Maraudine Key Fragment to Uthek the Wise in the Gelkis Village.",zone="Desolace",questName="Khan Hratha",lore="The Gelkis Khan is dead, and now the Maraudine will fall! Kill the Maraudine Khan, Hratha! To face him, blow the horn on the high bluff in the Valley of Spears."},
    [6792]={name="Sanguine Pauldrons",quality=2,ilvl=40,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Karnitol Shipwreck'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Desolace. Objective: Return to Kreldig Ungor in Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="The Karnitol Shipwreck",lore="Take Karnitol's things back to Roetten in Ironforge and he'll pay you for a job well done. Haha, if you're not careful, he's gonna be so pleased with ya that he'll ask you to join us full time."},
    [6793]={name="Auric Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=40,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Reagents for Reclaimers Inc.'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Kreldig Ungor in Ironforge. Objective: Bring Leftwitch's Package back to Roetten Stonehammer in Ironforge.",zone="Desolace",questName="Reagents for Reclaimers Inc.",lore="To get paid, you're gonna have to get back to Ironforge and speak to Roetten himself. He'll love getting Leftwitch's package out of the way anyway."},
    [6798]={name="Blasting Hackbut",quality=2,ilvl=37,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Questioning Reethe'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ogron in Dustwallow Marsh. Objective: Go with Ogron to speak with Reethe, then return to Krog in Brackenwall Village.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Questioning Reethe",lore="It took a long time, but I found Reethe. He hide good for a human. Ogron worried that he might be crazy after so much time in swamp. You come with me for we go get answers from him."},
    [6828]={name="Visionary Buckler",quality=2,ilvl=38,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Galen's Escape'. Starts with Galen Goodward in Swamp of Sorrows. Objective: Escort Galen out of danger, then find his camp in the Swamp of Sorrows and open his strongbox.",zone="Swamp of Sorrows",questName="Galen's Escape",lore="Please help! These creatures are going to eat me! Help me out of here, and I'll give you a great treasure! It's in my camp in the swamp north of Stonard, but it's locked in a strongbox that can be opened through a trick that only I know."},
    [6829]={name="Sword of Serenity",quality=3,ilvl=44,reqLevel=34,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'In the Name of the Light'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Raleigh the Devout in Scarlet Monastery. Objective: Kill High Inquisitor Whitemane, Scarlet Commander Mograine, Herod, the Scarlet Champion and Houndmaster Loksey and then report back to Raleigh the Devout in Southshore.",zone="Scarlet Monastery",questName="In the Name of the Light",lore="I once served the Scarlet Crusade with honor, loyalty and pride. I believed their cause to be a noble one: to rid Azeroth of the undead."},
    [6830]={name="Bonebiter",quality=3,ilvl=44,reqLevel=34,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'In the Name of the Light'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Raleigh the Devout in Scarlet Monastery. Objective: Kill High Inquisitor Whitemane, Scarlet Commander Mograine, Herod, the Scarlet Champion and Houndmaster Loksey and then report back to Raleigh the Devout in Southshore.",zone="Scarlet Monastery",questName="In the Name of the Light",lore="I once served the Scarlet Crusade with honor, loyalty and pride. I believed their cause to be a noble one: to rid Azeroth of the undead."},
    [6831]={name="Black Menace",quality=3,ilvl=44,reqLevel=34,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'In the Name of the Light'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Raleigh the Devout in Scarlet Monastery. Objective: Kill High Inquisitor Whitemane, Scarlet Commander Mograine, Herod, the Scarlet Champion and Houndmaster Loksey and then report back to Raleigh the Devout in Southshore.",zone="Scarlet Monastery",questName="In the Name of the Light",lore="I once served the Scarlet Crusade with honor, loyalty and pride. I believed their cause to be a noble one: to rid Azeroth of the undead."},
    [6834]={name="Black Tuxedo",quality=1,ilvl=1,sourceType="object_drop",instructions="Found in a container.",npc="a container"},
    [6835]={name="Black Tuxedo Pants",quality=1,ilvl=23,sourceType="object_drop",instructions="Found in a container.",npc="a container"},
    [6902]={name="Bands of Serra'kis",quality=3,ilvl=27,reqLevel=22,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Old Serra'kis.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Old Serra'kis",lore="Serra'kis is the great water beast the naga breed in the flooded halls of Blackfathom Deeps, and the reason the lower temple is under water at all."},
    [6905]={name="Reef Axe",quality=3,ilvl=27,reqLevel=22,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Gelihast.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Gelihast"},
    [6906]={name="Algae Fists",quality=3,ilvl=28,reqLevel=23,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Gelihast.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Gelihast"},
    [6907]={name="Tortoise Armor",quality=3,ilvl=27,reqLevel=22,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ghamoo-ra.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Ghamoo-ra"},
    [6909]={name="Strike of the Hydra",quality=3,ilvl=31,reqLevel=26,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Aku'mai.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Aku'mai"},
    [6966]={name="Elunite Axe",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Weapons of Elunite'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mathiel in Darnassus. Objective: &lt;name&gt;, I have crafted these weapons with the elunite you brought to me. &nbsp;Please, take whichever most suits you.And I must thank you. &nbsp;Working with elunite is both an honor and a pleasure.",zone="Darnassus",questName="Weapons of Elunite"},
    [6967]={name="Elunite Sword",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Weapons of Elunite'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mathiel in Darnassus. Objective: &lt;name&gt;, I have crafted these weapons with the elunite you brought to me. &nbsp;Please, take whichever most suits you.And I must thank you. &nbsp;Working with elunite is both an honor and a pleasure.",zone="Darnassus",questName="Weapons of Elunite"},
    [6969]={name="Elunite Dagger",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Weapons of Elunite'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mathiel in Darnassus. Objective: &lt;name&gt;, I have crafted these weapons with the elunite you brought to me. &nbsp;Please, take whichever most suits you.And I must thank you. &nbsp;Working with elunite is both an honor and a pleasure.",zone="Darnassus",questName="Weapons of Elunite"},
    [6971]={name="Fire Hardened Coif",quality=2,ilvl=31,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Grimand's Armor'. Starts with Grimand Elmore in Stormwind City. Objective: I can barely believe it! &nbsp;Furen's technique was a success, and this armor should withstand tremendous levels of stress.Here you are, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;And thank you. &nbsp;I wouldn't have believed Furen's discovery if you hadn't gathered the materials I needed to test it myself.",zone="Stormwind City",questName="Grimand's Armor"},
    [6972]={name="Fire Hardened Hauberk",quality=3,ilvl=30,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Furen's Armor'. Starts with Furen Longbeard in Stormwind City. Objective: Here's your armor, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;This will stand up to the strongest assaults or my name isn't Furen Longbeard!And I have to thank you. &nbsp;I learned a lot while working with the materials you brought me. &nbsp;I think I'll have another breakthrough one day!I'm going to send what I learned to other blacksmiths of the Alliance.I'll tell them you were a big help, and maybe they'll want to return the favor.",zone="Stormwind City",questName="Furen's Armor"},
    [6973]={name="Fire Hardened Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=29,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mathiel's Armor'. The quest is in Darnassus. Objective: I have finished with your piece of armor, and I am quite pleased. &nbsp;Furen's new techniques meshed perfectly with my own and I am sure this armor will prove to be quite resilient.Thank you, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;And may this serve you well in future battles.",zone="Darnassus",questName="Mathiel's Armor"},
    [6974]={name="Fire Hardened Gauntlets",quality=2,ilvl=31,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Klockmort's Creation'. Starts with Klockmort Spannerspan in Ironforge. Objective: Here's your armor, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;Furen's process worked brilliantly! &nbsp;Perfectly! &nbsp;Marvelously, truly!You could run this armor over with a siege engine and it would spring right back into shape!",zone="Ironforge",questName="Klockmort's Creation"},
    [6975]={name="Whirlwind Axe",quality=3,ilvl=40,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Whirlwind Weapon'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Bath'rah the Windwatcher in Alterac Mountains. Objective: I have the whirlwind heart, and am ready to place it within your vessel of choice.Choose your weapon, &lt;name&gt;, and know that its power is the power of Cyclonian.",zone="Alterac Mountains",questName="Whirlwind Weapon",lore="The Whirlwind Axe comes from an elemental trial a warrior has to complete alone. Three weapons come from the same chain and you keep only one."},
    [6976]={name="Whirlwind Warhammer",quality=3,ilvl=40,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Whirlwind Weapon'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Bath'rah the Windwatcher in Alterac Mountains. Objective: I have the whirlwind heart, and am ready to place it within your vessel of choice.Choose your weapon, &lt;name&gt;, and know that its power is the power of Cyclonian.",zone="Alterac Mountains",questName="Whirlwind Weapon"},
    [6977]={name="Whirlwind Sword",quality=3,ilvl=40,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Whirlwind Weapon'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Bath'rah the Windwatcher in Alterac Mountains. Objective: I have the whirlwind heart, and am ready to place it within your vessel of choice.Choose your weapon, &lt;name&gt;, and know that its power is the power of Cyclonian.",zone="Alterac Mountains",questName="Whirlwind Weapon",lore="One of three weapons from the same solitary warrior trial. Choosing it means giving up the axe and the staff for good."},
    [6978]={name="Umbral Axe",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Grey Iron Weapons'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Tormus Deepforge in Ironforge. Objective: Here are some weapons, hot off the anvil and made with the new umbral ore you brought me!Please, &lt;name&gt;, take your pick! A level 10 Quest.",zone="Ironforge",questName="Grey Iron Weapons"},
    [6979]={name="Haggard's Axe",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Dead-tooth Jack'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Marshal Haggard in Elwynn Forest. Objective: Retrieve Haggard's Badge from Dead-tooth Jack's camp, and return to Marshal Haggard.",zone="Elwynn Forest",questName="Dead-tooth Jack",lore="Burlguard sent you, did he? Yes, I have spare weapons around here, but first I have a task for you... A while ago a Defias villain Dead-tooth Jack tricked me."},
    [6980]={name="Haggard's Dagger",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Dead-tooth Jack'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Marshal Haggard in Elwynn Forest. Objective: Retrieve Haggard's Badge from Dead-tooth Jack's camp, and return to Marshal Haggard.",zone="Elwynn Forest",questName="Dead-tooth Jack",lore="Burlguard sent you, did he? Yes, I have spare weapons around here, but first I have a task for you... A while ago a Defias villain Dead-tooth Jack tricked me."},
    [6981]={name="Umbral Dagger",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Grey Iron Weapons'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Tormus Deepforge in Ironforge. Objective: Here are some weapons, hot off the anvil and made with the new umbral ore you brought me!Please, &lt;name&gt;, take your pick! A level 10 Quest.",zone="Ironforge",questName="Grey Iron Weapons"},
    [6984]={name="Umbral Sword",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Grey Iron Weapons'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Tormus Deepforge in Ironforge. Objective: Here are some weapons, hot off the anvil and made with the new umbral ore you brought me!Please, &lt;name&gt;, take your pick! A level 10 Quest.",zone="Ironforge",questName="Grey Iron Weapons"},
    [6985]={name="Haggard's Sword",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Dead-tooth Jack'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Marshal Haggard in Elwynn Forest. Objective: Retrieve Haggard's Badge from Dead-tooth Jack's camp, and return to Marshal Haggard.",zone="Elwynn Forest",questName="Dead-tooth Jack",lore="Burlguard sent you, did he? Yes, I have spare weapons around here, but first I have a task for you... A while ago a Defias villain Dead-tooth Jack tricked me."},
    [7002]={name="Arctic Buckler",quality=3,ilvl=29,reqLevel=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Blackfathom Villainy'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Blackfathom Villainy",lore="Strength has left me. Your help is needed! Long ago this site was a great temple of Elune. But misfortune led to ruin when the corruption of an Old God seeped up from beneath the earth and tainted the sacred Moon Well."},
    [7003]={name="Beetle Clasps",quality=3,ilvl=26,reqLevel=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Researching the Corruption'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gershala Nightwhisper in Darkshore. Objective: Gershala Nightwhisper in Auberdine wants 8 Corrupt Brain stems.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Researching the Corruption",lore="Foolish blood elves toil with demonic magic. Have they not witnessed what happened with the naga and with the satyrs of Kalimdor? I fear that the blood elves will meet a similar deformation."},
    [7053]={name="Azure Silk Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=35,reqLevel=30,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Tailoring (requires skill 1).",profession="Tailoring"},
    [7107]={name="Belt of the Stars",quality=2,ilvl=33,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Look To The Stars'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Viktori Prism'Antras in Duskwood. Objective: Locate Zzarc'Vul in the southern ogre mound in Duskwood and return his monocle to Viktori in Darkshire.",zone="Duskwood",questName="Look To The Stars",lore="Now there is just one more item needed to complete this device. Cog's blueprint calls for a lens of some sort. The only lens I know of that would be large enough will be very difficult to acquire."},
    [7115]={name="Heirloom Axe",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Heirloom Weapon'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Coleman Farthing in Tirisfal Glades. Objective: I will keep three of the weapons you returned to me, as mementos of my pain and loss. &nbsp;But please, &lt;name&gt;, choose your favorite of the heirlooms and keep it for yourself.May it serve you greater than it served its cursed, former owners.",zone="Tirisfal Glades",questName="Heirloom Weapon"},
    [7116]={name="Heirloom Dagger",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Heirloom Weapon'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Coleman Farthing in Tirisfal Glades. Objective: I will keep three of the weapons you returned to me, as mementos of my pain and loss. &nbsp;But please, &lt;name&gt;, choose your favorite of the heirlooms and keep it for yourself.May it serve you greater than it served its cursed, former owners.",zone="Tirisfal Glades",questName="Heirloom Weapon"},
    [7118]={name="Heirloom Sword",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Heirloom Weapon'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Coleman Farthing in Tirisfal Glades. Objective: I will keep three of the weapons you returned to me, as mementos of my pain and loss. &nbsp;But please, &lt;name&gt;, choose your favorite of the heirlooms and keep it for yourself.May it serve you greater than it served its cursed, former owners.",zone="Tirisfal Glades",questName="Heirloom Weapon"},
    [7129]={name="Brutal Gauntlets",quality=2,ilvl=31,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Brutal Gauntlets'. Starts with Ula'elek in Durotar. Objective: Thank you, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;These gauntlets are my best work. &nbsp;Take them. In wearing them, you bring honor to me and my ancestors.",zone="Durotar",questName="Brutal Gauntlets"},
    [7130]={name="Brutal Helm",quality=2,ilvl=31,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Brutal Helm'. Starts with Orm Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff. Objective: I give this helm to you.Great deeds brought you to me, &lt;name&gt;, and Earthmother willing... even greater deeds lie before you. A quest. Always up to date.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="Brutal Helm"},
    [7132]={name="Brutal Legguards",quality=2,ilvl=29,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Brutal Legguards'. Starts with Velora Nitely in Undercity. Objective: Here are your legguards, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;Let me know how they fit or if you need any modifications. &nbsp;I aim to please! &nbsp;At least I used to.These days I don't care much for my craft. &nbsp;But it beats being a mindless minion of the Scourge!I guess.",zone="Undercity",questName="Brutal Legguards"},
    [7133]={name="Brutal Hauberk",quality=3,ilvl=30,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Brutal Hauberk'. Starts with Thun'grim Firegaze in The Barrens. Objective: I am sure you endured much hardship and shed much blood on my task, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;Here is the product of your toil.May you wear it well, and may you one day return here with stories of its service to you.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Brutal Hauberk"},
    [7166]={name="Copper Dagger",quality=1,ilvl=11,reqLevel=6,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 1).",profession="Blacksmithing"},
    [7229]={name="Explorer's Vest",quality=2,ilvl=13,reqLevel=7,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bashal'Aran'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Asterion in Darkshore. Objective: Destroy the Ancient Moonstone Seal at the ancient flame in Ameth'Aran, then return to Asterion in Bashal'Aran.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Bashal'Aran",lore="It was the craft of one of the most powerful of the Highborne that created the seal that formed my prison. In Ameth'Aran, the ruins to the south that are twin to these, persists even today an ancient flame, blue in color."},
    [7230]={name="Smite's Mighty Hammer",quality=3,ilvl=23,reqLevel=18,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Mr. Smite.",zone="The Deadmines",npc="Mr. Smite"},
    [7276]={name="Handstitched Leather Cloak",quality=1,ilvl=9,reqLevel=4,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 1).",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [7281]={name="Light Leather Bracers",quality=1,ilvl=14,reqLevel=9,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 1).",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [7326]={name="Thun'grim's Axe",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Forged Steel'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",questName="Forged Steel",lore="I will give you a weapon, but first you must aid me. The Razormanes to the northwest came into my camp a few nights past."},
    [7327]={name="Thun'grim's Dagger",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Forged Steel'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",questName="Forged Steel",lore="I will give you a weapon, but first you must aid me. The Razormanes to the northwest came into my camp a few nights past."},
    [7335]={name="Grizzly Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=28,reqLevel=17,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Reception from Tyrande'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Sentinel Thenysil in Darnassus. Objective: Find Tyrande Whisperwind in Darnassus.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Reception from Tyrande",lore="I am sure Tyrande Whisperwind herself would like to thank you for taking part in this mission. It may not appear so on the surface, but what you've helped start could very well strengthen our foothold in the Stonetalon Mountains."},
    [7336]={name="Wildwood Chain",quality=2,ilvl=24,reqLevel=17,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Reception from Tyrande'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Sentinel Thenysil in Darnassus. Objective: Find Tyrande Whisperwind in Darnassus.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Reception from Tyrande",lore="I am sure Tyrande Whisperwind herself would like to thank you for taking part in this mission. It may not appear so on the surface, but what you've helped start could very well strengthen our foothold in the Stonetalon Mountains."},
