    [19106]={name="Ice Barbed Spear",quality=3,ilvl=63,reqLevel=51,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Legend of Korrak'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Objective: According to legend, the leader of the mighty Winterax trolls appears at will to wreak havoc on the denizens of Alterac Valley.Should Korrak make himself known, destroy him and return to Warmaster Laggrond.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="The Legend of Korrak",lore="The invading Stormpike are not the only threat in the region, soldier. The war in the Valley is waged on two fronts. The cannibal Winterax trolls also vie for power."},
    [19107]={name="Bloodseeker",quality=3,ilvl=63,reqLevel=51,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Legend of Korrak'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Objective: According to legend, the leader of the mighty Winterax trolls appears at will to wreak havoc on the denizens of Alterac Valley.Should Korrak make himself known, destroy him and return to Warmaster Laggrond.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="The Legend of Korrak",lore="The invading Stormpike are not the only threat in the region, soldier. The war in the Valley is waged on two fronts. The cannibal Winterax trolls also vie for power."},
    [19114]={name="Highland Bow",quality=2,ilvl=51,reqLevel=46,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return to Primal Torntusk'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Return to Primal Torntusk",lore="Return to my mate, Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village. Tell her that I am coming home! She is sure to reward you."},
    [19117]={name="Laquered Wooden Plate Legplates",quality=2,ilvl=50,reqLevel=46,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Separation Anxiety'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Huntsman Markhor in The Hinterlands. Objective: Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to recover his twin brother's remains. Find and return Huntsman Malkhor's Skull and Huntsman Malkhor's Bones to Huntsman Markhor.Markhor mentioned that his brother's remains were fed to the oozes and wolves of the Vilebranch. He also mentioned that there is a refuse pit filled with oozes in Jintha'alor as well as a wolf den. Both of these places are near the top of the temple.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Separation Anxiety",lore="Like many in our village, I too have lost a loved one to the wilds. Alas, it was my twin brother Malkhor - taken in the same raid as Torntusk's mate by the Vilebranch."},
    [19120]={name="Rune of the Guard Captain",quality=2,ilvl=51,reqLevel=46,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Job Opening: Guard Captain of Revantusk Village'. The quest is in The Hinterlands. Objective: You have been tasked with the decimation of 20 Vilebranch Berserkers, 20 Vilebranch Shadow Hunters, 20 Vilebranch Blood Drinkers, and 20 Vilebranch Soul Eaters.Should you complete this task, return to Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Job Opening: Guard Captain of Revantusk Village",lore="With the loss of Guard Captain Malkhor, the position of Guard Captain of Revantusk is once again open.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to hit by 0.7%."},
    [19124]={name="Slagplate Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=48,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Searing Gorge. Objective: Find and return the Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass to Taskmaster Scrange in the Searing Gorge.The only information you have about these items is the following: They were definitely stolen by Dark Iron dwarves. The Smithing Tuyere is a blacksmithing tool used by blacksmiths and the Lookout's Spyglass is an invaluable monitoring tool to lookouts.",zone="Searing Gorge",questName="STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass",lore="The following items have been stolen: *One Dark Iron Tuyere. *One Lookout's Spyglass. A reward is being offered to individuals who find and return these pilfered items."},
    [19125]={name="Seared Mail Girdle",quality=2,ilvl=49,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Fiery Menace!'. Starts with Hansel Heavyhands in Searing Gorge. Objective: Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Greater Lava Spiders in the Searing Gorge. You can find Greater Lava Spiders in the plateaus and lava pools of the Searing Gorge.Return to Hansel Heavyhands in the Searing Gorge when you have killed enough Greater Lava Spiders.",zone="Searing Gorge",questName="Fiery Menace!",lore="Wouldn't ye know it, every time ol' Hansel wants to take a moment to relax and reflect upon his life, the powers that be give him another job."},
    [19126]={name="Slagplate Gauntlets",quality=2,ilvl=49,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Curse These Fat Fingers'. Starts with Hansel Heavyhands in Searing Gorge. Objective: Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Heavy War Golems.The Heavy War Golems wander the areas surrounding the Cauldron in the Searing Gorge. When you've killed enough, return to Hansel in Searing Gorge.",zone="Searing Gorge",questName="Curse These Fat Fingers",lore="Unfortunately, I can't dish out the beats like I used to, due to this here fat finger problem. Ye see, the climate out here combined with the lack o' air pressure makes me fingers expand."},
    [19139]={name="Fireguard Shoulders",quality=4,ilvl=71,reqLevel=60,sourceType="object_drop",instructions="Found in a container.",zone="Searing Gorge",npc="a container"},
    [19148]={name="Dark Iron Helm",quality=4,ilvl=66,reqLevel=60,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 1).",profession="Blacksmithing"},
    [19159]={name="Woven Ivy Necklace",quality=3,ilvl=51,reqLevel=46,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wanted: Vile Priestess Hexx and Her Minions'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in The Hinterlands. Objective: You have been ordered to slay Vile Priestess Hexx and 20 Vilebranch Aman'zasi Guards. See Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands once this task is complete.Vile Priestess Hexx and the Aman'zasi Guards can be found atop Jintha'alor in the Hinterlands.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Wanted: Vile Priestess Hexx and Her Minions",lore="By order of Primal Torntusk, Vile Priestess Hexx and her minions are to be brought to justice! A grand reward is offered for any that slay the Vile Priestess Hexx and all of her Aman'zasi elite guard."},
    [19164]={name="Dark Iron Gauntlets",quality=4,ilvl=70,reqLevel=60,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 1).",profession="Blacksmithing"},
    [19167]={name="Blackfury",quality=4,ilvl=66,reqLevel=60,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 1).",profession="Blacksmithing",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 1.0%."},
    [19168]={name="Blackguard",quality=4,ilvl=70,reqLevel=60,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 1).",profession="Blacksmithing",proc="Equip: Increases your chance to Parry an attack by 1.0%."},
