    [20640]={name="Southsea Head Bucket",quality=2,ilvl=45,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Southsea Shakedown'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Security Chief Bilgewhizzle in Tanaris. Objective: Security Chief Bilgewhizzle of Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris wants you to kill 10 Southsea Pirates, 10 Southsea Freebooters, 10 Southsea Dock Workers and 10 Southsea Swashbucklers.",zone="Tanaris",questName="Southsea Shakedown",lore="They want the impossible from me! The Steamwheedle Cartel wants me to teach the Southsea pirates a lesson."},
    [20643]={name="Undercity Reservist's Cap",quality=2,ilvl=47,reqLevel=42,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Oran's Gratitude'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Oran Snakewrithe in Undercity. Objective: Now isn't this interesting? You say you found this tablet on a small, deserted island at The Overlook Cliffs in The Hinterlands, &lt;class&gt;? Very interesting indeed. I thank you for your efforts in this matter. Our Dark Lady shall be very pleased with this discovery. Here, allow me to reward you proportionately.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Oran's Gratitude"},
